@startuml
title Stati osservabili e autorità

state "VBUS assente" as NoVbus
state "VBUS presente" as Vbus
state "Device presentato" as Presented
state "Host rilevato" as Connected
state "Indirizzo assegnato" as Addressed
state "Configurazione attiva" as Mounted
state "Classe pronta" as Ready
state "Route USB adottata" as Routed

[*] --> NoVbus
NoVbus --> Vbus : alimentazione rilevata
Vbus --> Presented : pull-up abilitato
Presented --> Connected : reset o setup packet
Connected --> Addressed : SET_ADDRESS
Addressed --> Mounted : SET_CONFIGURATION
Mounted --> Ready : requisiti di classe
Ready --> Routed : decisione applicativa

note right of Vbus
  Prova alimentazione,
  non comunicazione.
end note

note right of Mounted
  tud_mounted()
end note
@enduml
